   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5): REQUEST CHANGES**, head 3f9db8e (verbatim)\n\n1. **High**, `AccessibleColorsTests.swift:24,32`: trailing commas in the argument arrays break `trailing_comma` under `swiftlint --strict`. Fix: remove them.\n2. **Medium**, `Search/ForumSearchView.swift:33-41`: `ContentLoader.cancel()` sets `isLoading = false` and keeps `value`/`error`; \"Annuler\" on page 2 then announces the old \"25 résultats · p. 1\". Fix: say nothing when the load ended without a new value or error.\n3. **Medium**, `Navigation/LoadFailureView.swift:38`: the announcement hangs on `onAppear`: a failed retry says nothing; it repeats on return from a reader, tab switch or scroll (`UserProfileView:38`). Fix: post on the failure itself.\n4. **Low**, `MessageListView.swift:109`, `TopicListView.swift:316`: `.padding(12)` became `.padding(.leading, 12)`: no vertical padding at AX sizes.\n5. **Low**, `AccountMenuButton.swift:37`: `.isSelected` inside a `Menu` probably does nothing (needs Mac VoiceOver check; a menu `Picker` would give the native state).\n6. **Low**, tests: dark error text checked only on black and (28,28,30); at (54,54,56) it is 4.27:1.\n7. **Detail**, `ForumSearchView.swift:159`: `.combine` redundant inside a Button label; `theOldAccentCapsuleFailed` tests a constant.\n\nChecked by the reviewer: full diff and spec, #252, #646; swiftlint 0.65.1 reproduced; every contrast ratio recomputed.\n\n---\nAuthor response (next commit): 1 fixed; 2 fixed (no announcement after \"Annuler\"); 3 fixed for the sent banners (announced on change of the confirmation, not on appear), the failure banner announcement removed and listed as a follow-up in the spec; 4 fixed; 5 kept, listed under Mac checks; 6 fixed (dark error text (255,130,122), tests on (44,44,46) and (58,58,60), 4.7:1 minimum); 7 redundant `.combine` removed.\n\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
